<HISTITEMS>
<HISTITEM authorref='_0DF5D650' stid='0' tool='CANdelaStudio 10 ReleasePatch 2  Admin' dt='2019-09-26 15:45:03+08:00'>
<LABEL>1.4.0</LABEL>
<MOD>v1.4.0
Base IEM 1.4.0, the different element as below 
1) DID: change IEM（40DF）to MGM(40E0)
2) DTC:VddmPropFr08-&#62;VddmPropFr02 time out
3) DTC:EcmPropFr02(U2F1500)-&#62;EcmPropFr01(U2F1900)
4) DTC:Delete EcmPropFro04/EcmPropFro24


2)Protocol: RxID 0x731,TxID:0x631</MOD>
<REASON>Variants</REASON>
</HISTITEM>
