<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Healing Cycles</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Cycles necessary to heal/erase event. 
Note: Activate 'Self Healing (Aging)' when using this item</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_AGING_COUNTER</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<TRRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E13D938' oid='E377CD789B4847bfB7E7D85C9919AEDC' temploid='2CA0107F145D487a8C308DA165E0FF06' mayBeDup='1' conv='req'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Monitor Initialization Function</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Monitor initialization function is (not) required for this event</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_INIT_MONITOR_REQUIRED</QUAL>
<DEFAULT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not required</TUV>
</DEFAULT>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>required</TUV>
</CHOICE>
<CHOICE>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not required</TUV>
</CHOICE>
</TRRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1CCED8' oid='B2606CDA7C0743c79D89CAB0EDCBB3C6' temploid='B2D249520EA848fe961B1D8E08EABA93' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Priority</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Priority of an event, in view of full event buffer (ref. to Dem104)</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_PRIORITY_VALUE</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_05C8E4B8' oid='14073195AC2D4154A6E2D8CFFAFF6F84' temploid='C827388C8C574143ACBBABFBDDAE2D07' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Severity</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Reports the recommended action to be taken by the system (e.g. vehicle) operator</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_SEVERITY_VALUE</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>noSeverity</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='32'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>maintenanceOnly</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='64'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>checkAtNextHalt</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='128'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>checkImmediately</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_05C8EB48' oid='3443AA48CA98496f95CFD08F72843341' temploid='83B18212A90D4e1f82533C874ADAE8A3' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='1' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Pre-Debounce Algorithm</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Selects a Predebounce Algorithm</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_DEBOUNCING_ALGORITHM</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Time based</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Counter based</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1CDF28' oid='6350D9B0DB42411f8CFB490ADF7BDFF7' temploid='276CB991E44F42e1896A1AEDE5B743D0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Count-In step size</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Defines the Step size for incrementation (PREFAILED). Range: 0 - 127</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STEP_SIZE_PREFAILED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1CDD58' oid='2D2CE98DAC3841c7B2DC8EB8411DADBE' temploid='8B8A36466F6347edAB800152E4E2E7EA' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Count-out step size</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Defines the Step size for decrementation (PREPASSED). Range 0 - 127</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_STEP_SIZE_PREPASSED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_05C8D2E8' oid='339E12099EB041038A6A0888BDC6D58B' temploid='62E799B9AA974fab92E268C8C8A35D0D' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='1' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Use Jump-Up (Prefailed)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Switch for the activation of Jump-UP:
Jump to Zero upon a change of the reported result (i.e. when after a sequence of 'prepassed' the result changes to 'prefailed')</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_JUMP_UP_PREFAILED</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_05C8EE18' oid='D8416DB0A2B84a7f8376E4F1E927E669' temploid='5EC926ED11B2472f9736828AE5B285B0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Use Jump-Down (Prepassed)</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Switch for the activation of Jump-Down – only in combination with Jump-UP activation:
Jump to Zero upon a change of the reported result (i.e. when after a sequence of 'prefailed' the result changes to 'prepassed')</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_JUMP_DOWN_PREPASSED</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>No</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL id='_05C8D888' oid='9010E1F6627B4d2dAF45E6715698BB5A' temploid='210C30DD4208429fB1D4B63EC08D879E' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' v='0' sort='id'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Set WarningIndicatorBit at fault</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Yes -  the warningIndicatorRequested bit (bit 7) will be set at the same time as the confirmedDTC bit (bit 3) is set.
No - the warningIndicatorRequested bit (bit 7) is 0 at all times.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_WARNING_INDICATOR_FLAG</QUAL>
<ETAG v='0'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>supported</TUV>
</ETAG>
<ETAG v='1'>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>not supported</TUV>
</ETAG>
</ENUMRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1CDE40' oid='A7C2E7AA3EFC4bf5B6A2B1CE60B1D52F' temploid='9337448C222E485999CA41EE266FAAE0' mayBeDup='1' conv='req' df='hex' v='255'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Functional Unit</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>Can be used to identify the corresponding basic vehicle / system function which monitors this DTC.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_FUNCTIONAL_UNIT_VALUE</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1F0C10' oid='3B876C030F4C459fA772B3E1D0850CE9' temploid='339AFA87EF5A4f958A473043885048E4' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Debounce Failed Timeout Value</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter defines the time [ms] for event failed qualification of the DTC specific time based debouncing.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_TIMEOUT_VALUE_PREFAILED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
<UNSRECORDITEMTMPL id='_0E1F0EC8' oid='E4B8DA533FFA43b8A843CF2721AA0106' temploid='FB29614080F6487099754C380EAC45DA' mayBeDup='1' conv='opt' df='dec' v='0'>
<NAME>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DTC Debounce Passed Timeout Value</TUV>
</NAME>
<DESC>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>This parameter defines the time [ms] for event passed qualification of the DTC specific time based debouncing.</TUV>
</DESC>
<QUAL>DTC_TIMEOUT_VALUE_PREPASSED</QUAL>
</UNSRECORDITEMTMPL>
</RECORDTMPL>
