<TRRECORDITEM idref='_0E13CB00'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>DEM_POWER</TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<UNSRECORDITEM idref='_0E1CC3F8' v='0'/>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_0E13D820'>
<TEXT>
<TUV xml:lang='en-US'>When the ECU enters or exit the bus-off state.



The generic test run criteria A) below shall be fulfilled:



A)



DTC tests shall run all the time that the ECU is in operation, with exceptions according to below:



  1) The DTC tests shall be inhibited when electrical power availability is limited, as indicated by ElPowerLevel 1.



  2) All DTC tests shall be inhibited during 5 seconds from any transition from one car mode to another. The inhibition shall start at notational consumption of the 'car mode' signal when a change of car mode is requested and shall be active for 5 s ± 2s.



  3) All DTC tests shall be inhibited when the vehicle is set in any of the car modes Factory, Transport or Crash.



</TUV>
</TEXT>
</TRRECORDITEM>
<ENUMRECORDITEM idref='_05C8D6A8' v='0'/>
<TRRECORDITEM idref='_0E13D708'>
